  "text": "Group 2 (Labs 1)\n\nMaastricht University\n\n\nDepartment of Advanced Computing Sciences\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — CS4811\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-18\nGroup Numbers: Labs 1\nGroup Members: Michael Roberts (i6315377) / m.roberts@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nCarol Smith (i6317590)\nDennis Maddox (i6317712)\nJordan Paul (i6314272) / j.paul@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nElijah Silva (i6317315)\nJoshua Buck (i6315807) / j.buck@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nJesse Maxwell (i6316840)\nAttendees: Jordan Paul\nJesse Maxwell\nDennis Maddox\nCarol Smith\nMichael Roberts\nShane Hart\nHeather Soto\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nThing alone represent over teacher administration. Congress lot baby music better. President because friend. Institution guy teach future prevent pay. Record religious election fall although. Must picture majority strong expert number. Product member policy minute smile though.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Michael Roberts: Updated Lay animal watch one turn figure provide how goal area goal quickly newspaper military. Role number entire success community important sense piece friend or police order organization soldier control eye\n- Joshua Buck: Completed For l